       "{'fastmux.skill': 'Live handles for tmux sessions, windows, and panes, plus named background sessions driven by sid. Use this when code needs to read terminal screens or scrollback, drive interactive processes, build pane layouts, search text across terminals, or keep a persistent terminal session that both an agent and the user can inspect and drive.',\n",
